    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/classic-events/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Classic Events is a versatile and elegant theme designed for event organizers, conference planners, and individuals hosting various gatherings, including weddings, corporate events, conferences, parties, seminars, trade shows, banquets, galas, networking events, fundraisers, anniversaries, launches, concerts, festivals, and exhibitions. Ideal for event website templates, conference layouts, wedding portals, corporate event pages, party planning sites, seminar schedules, and festival showcases, this theme features a clean, minimalist design with a professional and polished appearance. With extensive customization options and flexible templates, users can tailor layouts to showcase speaker profiles, agendas, ticketing information, event schedules, and photo galleries. Built with responsive design and optimized code, Classic Events ensures a seamless browsing experience on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Integration with essential plugins for event management, registration forms, ticketing, and email marketing streamlines logistics and attendee management. Its user-friendly interface, intuitive navigation, and modern features make it easy to engage visitors, increase attendance, and create a professional, high-performing online presence for events of any scale."
    },
